  "details": "When using the VRC camera's dolly feature, it would be incredibly useful to be able to have more manual control over where I wish to point the camera during its movement, instead of relying on precise keyframes.\n\nThis way, it allows for more flexibility and control and moving subjects feel less restricted to the confines of precise keyframes.\n\nThe addition of stabilization to the hand rotation control would also be very beneficial to smooth out potential shakes from the camera as well as dampen the sensitivity.",
